        <mxCell id="qG1CX550eW5Vu7yh7KZ0-46" edge="1" parent="OYxe-6S0gIPfw5g497Zp-1" source="qG1CX550eW5Vu7yh7KZ0-29" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="qG1CX550eW5Vu7yh7KZ0-30">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qG1CX550eW5Vu7yh7KZ0-47" parent="OYxe-6S0gIPfw5g497Zp-1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;size=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;What the Viewer member may READ (DEV, containment resolved)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Record level (which rows):&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;dmn_demand.* read: add sn_ppm_read&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;cost_plan.* read: add sn_ppm_finance_read&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;u_cost_distribution read: add sn_ppm_finance_read&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Table: u_related_link (record read: it_demand_user, it_project_user) and u_related_link.* (field read: it_demand_user): the reader does not see the WACKER &quot;Related links&quot; of demands and projects. Add sn_ppm_read to both if in scope; same decision as cost distributions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Group&lt;/b&gt; description of Strategic Planning Workspace Viewer for the IAM catalogue. Open, text only.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;dmn_demand.planned and pm_project.planned (OOTB scoped field ACLs, portfolio_manager only): the reader does not see the &quot;Selected for execution&quot; flag. Minor.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Field level (which values):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;pm_project.* passes through timecard_user (contained in sn_ppm_read), planned_task.* lists sn_ppm_read, the other tables have no table.* read ACL.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Write, create, delete on these tables: none.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;No allowing ACL of any of them lists sn_ppm_read, sn_ppm_finance_read, ap_read_only, spw_goal_user_read or any role they contain.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The WACKER New buttons (WackerPPMAccessUtils) check demand and project roles the Viewer does not have.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;To do for Q1:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;new field ACL &lt;b&gt;dmn_demand.*&lt;/b&gt; read for &lt;b&gt;sn_ppm_read&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;field ACL &lt;b&gt;cost_plan.*&lt;/b&gt; read: add &lt;b&gt;sn_ppm_finance_read&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;u_cost_distribution read ACL: add sn_ppm_finance_read (if in scope).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Group description of Strategic Planning Workspace Viewer: &quot;SPM: read-only access to demands, projects, programs, portfolios, cost plans, planning items and goals. No create, no update.&quot; (visible in IAM)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="416" width="723" x="-1153" y="655" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qG1CX550eW5Vu7yh7KZ0-53" edge="1" parent="OYxe-6S0gIPfw5g497Zp-1" source="qG1CX550eW5Vu7yh7KZ0-23" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="qG1CX550eW5Vu7yh7KZ0-5">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-698" y="440" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="-884" y="712" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
