          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eYe9wFqOF_ho6mbTrtVT-91" parent="kwtiYubsfSb8hSpjcVgx-1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;size=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;What a member of Strategic Planning Workspace User may do&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;; font-size: 10px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;  x  Open Strategic Planning Workspace                                        (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Portfolio plans shared with the user: read                               (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Portfolio plans: create, delete, edit fields                             (apw_user, owner or editor)&lt;br&gt;  x  Work notes on shared plans and scenarios                                 (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Planning items of shared plans: read                                     (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Planning items: create, update, delete                                   (apw_user)&lt;br&gt;  x  Planning item cost fields (planned/actual cost, capex, opex, benefit, RO (sn_ppm_finance_read)&lt;br&gt;  x  Planning item planned capex, opex, benefit: write                        (spw_financial_user)&lt;br&gt;  x  Scenarios: read                                                          (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Scenarios: create, edit, delete                                          (apw_user, owner or editor)&lt;br&gt;  x  Scenarios: approve                                                       (scenario_approver)&lt;br&gt;  x  Goals and targets: read; Goals page in the workspace                     (sn_gf.goal_user_read; the page is shown to spw_goal_user_read, spw_goal_user, business_stakeholder)&lt;br&gt;  x  Goals and targets: create; edit or delete goals that are own, contribute (sn_gf.goal_user; ACL conditions sn_gf_goal write/delete)&lt;br&gt;  x  Demands, projects, programs, portfolios, resource plans: read            (sn_ppm_read; demand fields need the &lt;b&gt;NEW&lt;/b&gt; field ACL)&lt;br&gt;  x  Cost plans, breakdowns, budget lines, expense lines: read                (sn_ppm_finance_read)&lt;br&gt;  x  Cost plans, breakdowns, expense lines: create, edit                      (sn_spm_financial_user, write conditional)&lt;br&gt;  x  Fund allocation to planning items                                        (spw_funding_user)&lt;br&gt;  x  Plan document pages: edit content                                        (OOTB ACLs on ap_read_only and sn_ppm_read)&lt;br&gt;  x  Plan document pages: create, delete                                      (apw_user)&lt;br&gt;  x  Import/export planning items to Agile and PPM, strategies CRUD, mileston (role descriptions of sn_align_cmn_int.user, strategy_planner, milestone_editor, pf_basic)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;What this group does NOT have (and which of the other two has it: V = Viewer, G = Goal Admin)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;; font-size: 10px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ServiceNow intent.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;apw_user&lt;/b&gt; is the vendor role for planners (portfolio and product managers, business unit leads): &quot;navigate the planning hierarchy, create, update and delete planning items, edit roadmaps&quot;;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;it contains &lt;b&gt;ap_read_only&lt;/b&gt;, so every planner is also a viewer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;scenario_approver&lt;/b&gt; (&quot;Can approve scenarios for portfolio plans assigned to them&quot;),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;spw_financial_user&lt;/b&gt; (&quot;Can create cost plans and expense lines for demands and projects&quot;)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;spw_funding_user&lt;/b&gt; (&quot;This role can allocate funds to planning item&quot;) are separate vendor roles for the finance side of planning;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="428" width="1077" x="-1046" y="1923" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eYe9wFqOF_ho6mbTrtVT-92" parent="kwtiYubsfSb8hSpjcVgx-1" style="html=1;outlineConnect=0;whiteSpace=wrap;shape=mxgraph.archimate3.application;appType=role;archiType=square;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;sn_gf.goal_user_read&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="86" width="244" x="-552" y="1374" as="geometry" />
