        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-13" parent="EtLR9b95IYh6tztjF3i--1" style="html=1;outlineConnect=0;whiteSpace=wrap;shape=mxgraph.archimate3.application;appType=passive;archiType=square;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=24;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;Portfolio plans&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Visible only when the plan is shared with the member: the plan&#39;s Owned by, Editors, Viewers, Group editors or Group viewers contain the user or one of his groups (Manage Access on the plan). A plan that is not shared is not visible.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scenarios and scenario items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Same sharing as the plan they belong to (owner, viewers, editors, group viewers, group editors).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Planning items of those plans&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;In the workspace: the items of the shared plans (navigation goes through the plan). In lists, reports and APIs: every planning item, the record read ACL for &lt;b&gt;ap_read_only&lt;/b&gt; has no condition.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="184" width="330" x="-979" y="325" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-14" edge="1" parent="EtLR9b95IYh6tztjF3i--1" source="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-5" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-13">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-19" parent="EtLR9b95IYh6tztjF3i--1" style="html=1;outlineConnect=0;whiteSpace=wrap;shape=mxgraph.archimate3.application;appType=passive;archiType=square;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=24;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;Demands, projects, programs, portfolios, resource plans behind the planning items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;All rows, no condition. Demand field values only with the &lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;NEW&lt;/b&gt; field ACL (&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;dmn_demand.* read for sn_ppm_read&lt;/b&gt;). Project field values pass through timecard_user. Cost distributions and related links: not readable (&lt;b&gt;NEW ACL needed&lt;/b&gt;)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="89" width="330" x="-599" y="351" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-20" edge="1" parent="EtLR9b95IYh6tztjF3i--1" source="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-6" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-19">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-21" parent="EtLR9b95IYh6tztjF3i--1" style="html=1;outlineConnect=0;whiteSpace=wrap;shape=mxgraph.archimate3.application;appType=passive;archiType=square;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=24;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;Cost figures of the planning items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Planned and actual cost, capex, opex, benefit, ROI: nine field ACLs that list &lt;b&gt;sn_ppm_finance_read&lt;/b&gt;. Without this role the item is shown without figures (the Goal Admin case).&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cost plans, breakdowns, budget lines, expense lines of demands and projects&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;All rows, no condition. Cost plan field values only with &lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(245, 5, 5), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;NEW&lt;/b&gt; (custom field ACL &lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;cost_plan.*&lt;/b&gt; read lists only demand and project roles).&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="138" width="330" x="-337" y="452" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-22" edge="1" parent="EtLR9b95IYh6tztjF3i--1" source="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-7" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-21">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-25" parent="EtLR9b95IYh6tztjF3i--1" style="html=1;outlineConnect=0;whiteSpace=wrap;shape=mxgraph.archimate3.application;appType=passive;archiType=square;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=24;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;Goals and targets&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Goals page of the workspace shown to &lt;b&gt;spw_goal_user_read&lt;/b&gt;;&lt;div&gt;Goals of a plan appear when the plan&#39;s &quot;Goals module enabled&quot; is set, filtered by the plan&#39;s Goals filter condition.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;All goals readable (no condition);&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="298" x="-1144" y="212" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-26" edge="1" parent="EtLR9b95IYh6tztjF3i--1" source="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-8" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-25">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pFw31T5AQ8Kh2f5u5L0b-27" parent="EtLR9b95IYh6tztjF3i--1" style="html=1;outlineConnect=0;whiteSpace=wrap;shape=mxgraph.archimate3.application;appType=passive;archiType=square;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=24;fontSize=10;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;To do for Q3&lt;/b&gt; - Workspace Viewer sees all goals, costs, demands and projects published to him, read-only&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Roles and group: nothing to change. The group Strategic Planning Workspace Viewer keeps its three roles; no new role, no new group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;New field ACL &quot;dmn_demand.*&quot;&lt;/b&gt;, operation read, type record, roles &lt;b&gt;sn_ppm_read&lt;/b&gt;, admin overrides true.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;b&gt;sn_ppm_finance_read&lt;/b&gt; to the roles of the existing field ACL &quot;&lt;b&gt;cost_plan.*&lt;/b&gt;&quot;, operation read. Effect: cost plan rows show their field values.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;b&gt;sn_ppm_finance_read&lt;/b&gt; to the roles of the read ACL &quot;&lt;b&gt;u_cost_distribution&lt;/b&gt;&quot; (today it_project_user only). Only if cost distributions belong to what a viewer may see.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;b&gt;sn_ppm_read&lt;/b&gt; to the roles of the read ACLs &quot;&lt;b&gt;u_related_link&lt;/b&gt;&quot; (record) and &quot;&lt;b&gt;u_related_link.*&lt;/b&gt;&quot; (field) (today it_demand_user and it_project_user).&amp;nbsp; Only if the WACKER related links belong to what a viewer may see.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;On every portfolio plan the viewers should see: open Manage Access and add the group Strategic Planning Workspace Viewer as Group viewer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;On those plans set &quot;Goals module enabled&quot; and, if only some goals should show, the &quot;Goals filter condition&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set the description of the group Strategic Planning Workspace Viewer so that the IAM catalogue says what it gives, for example: &quot;SPM: read-only access to demands, projects, programs, portfolios, cost plans, planning items and goals. No create, no update.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="777" x="-1135" y="602" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
