        <mxCell id="y578fc2lkKVI6xUaZfkh-119" parent="RGOiq4gey57imG2aMLxf-1" style="html=1;outlineConnect=0;whiteSpace=wrap;shape=mxgraph.archimate3.application;appType=passive;archiType=square;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=24;fontSize=10;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;b&gt;Any task: state, assigned to, priority, impact, urgency, due date, description, comments, work notes: write&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lost with the merge but for SPM it is not needed, project tasks are covered by project_manager." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="62" width="340" x="590" y="709" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y578fc2lkKVI6xUaZfkh-120" edge="1" parent="RGOiq4gey57imG2aMLxf-1" source="y578fc2lkKVI6xUaZfkh-95" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="y578fc2lkKVI6xUaZfkh-119">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y578fc2lkKVI6xUaZfkh-121" parent="RGOiq4gey57imG2aMLxf-1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;size=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-position: inside;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;A5 - Answer to Q5. No blocker: the merged group can carry both roles and nothing on the instance refers to either group. But on DEV the merge is only half done.&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-position: inside;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;What happened? ITBM_Demand_Managers was renamed to ITBM_Demand_Project_Managers (LDAP name still cn=ITBM_Demand_Managers); its roles were not touched. ITBM_Project_Managers was set inactive;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;To do to finish the merge.&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-position: inside;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;PMO decision: may every member of the merged group create and delete budget lines and set the planned flag (portfolio_manager)? If not: replace it_portfolio_manager in the group by it_project_manager; portfolio rights stay in ITBM_Demand_Coordination_Managers and ITBM_PMO, which hold it_portfolio_manager.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rename the LDAP entry cn=ITBM_Demand_Managers to the new group name, so that IAM and ServiceNow agree.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Description of the merged group for IAM, for example: &quot;SPM: demand manager and project manager. Create and edit demands, projects, cost plans and resource plans; read portfolios and the Strategic Planning Workspace.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="255" width="758" x="183" y="826" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
